<Sync time="117.172"/>
mahyá: n' chakaymekat, chakaykowit. Ke:meh n' chakaykowit ihkó:n n' ime..., imekayo. Mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="125.339" endTime="127.332">
<Sync time="125.339"/>
¿Wa:n ixiwyo?
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="127.332" endTime="186.378">
<Sync time="127.332"/>
Ixiwyo semi ehe:yi no: mochi:wa, ehe:yi sah.
<Sync time="131.546"/>
Pero e:..., ma:ski ixiwyo *o** ma:ski ne: ikomekayo,
<Sync time="137.005"/>
