<Sync time="334.111"/>
Mm. Yehwa ne: wehka:w ta:tahmeh ika tikitayah kimpahtia:yah n' kone:meh.
<Sync time="339.404"/>
Ke:mah. Neh nik...,
<Sync time="343.297"/>
